        {
          "text": "Ino nkaambonz, nindakasika katakwe muntu? Nindakaita, nkaambonzi katakwe iwakavuwa? Sa ijanza lyangu lyafwinsigwa akukacilwa kufutula? Sa ndabula inguzu zyakuvuna? Amubone! Kutapatila kwangu nkokuyuminizya lwizi. Ndasandula milonga kuti ibe inkanda, azyalo inswi zyayo zilanunka nkaambo kakubula maanzi, anyota ilazijaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
