        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Jehova wandipa lulimi lwabaiyide, kuti nzibe kwaamba majwi aakugwasya bakateede. Ulandibusya cifumo acifumo, ulabusya matwi aangu kuti nswiilile mbubaswiilila basikwiiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
