        {
          "text": "Ndakaabila basikuuma musana wangu, amaseya aangu ndakaabila basikunonkola malezu. Nsikwe kusisa busyu bwangu kubweeme akukuswidwa maate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.6",
